1
00:00:00,288 --> 00:00:02,998
I don't understand your objections,
Professor Goldfarb.

2
00:00:03,166 --> 00:00:06,796
Why wouldn't the Sonora Desert
make a perfectly good Promised Land?

3
00:00:07,587 --> 00:00:09,087
(Leonard:)Go away.

4
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:13,050
We could call it Nuevo Jerusalem.

5
00:00:13,885 --> 00:00:15,385
(Goldfarb:)Please go away.

6
00:00:16,471 --> 00:00:18,641
Said Pharaoh to Moses.

7
00:00:19,891 --> 00:00:21,891
(Gablehouser:)Why are all these young women here?

8
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,890
(Leonard:)It's Take Your Daughter to Work Day.

9
00:00:24,437 --> 00:00:25,977
Really? I was not aware of that.

10
00:00:26,147 --> 00:00:28,437
(Raj:)Oh, yes.
There was a very official e-mail...

11
00:00:28,608 --> 00:00:31,238
(Raj:)...that was sent to everyone
whose files indicated...

12
00:00:31,403 --> 00:00:34,243
(Raj:)...they had daughters
between the ages of 14 and 16.

13
00:00:34,573 --> 00:00:35,613
(Leonard(in a Yoda voice):)Hmm.

14
00:00:35,782 --> 00:00:37,822
- Smooth.
- Thank you.

15
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:42,120
(Gablehouser:)There's the man of the hour.

16
00:00:42,706 --> 00:00:47,126
So we have a socially awkward genius in
a room of attractive age-appropriate women.

17
00:00:47,294 --> 00:00:58,024
All he has to do is hook up with one.

